21576b9f-eae9-46f6-ae15-e1ab672dc468	february-2026-eyes	February 2026 - eyes	<p>👁️&nbsp;An&nbsp;object-based&nbsp;challenge&nbsp;for&nbsp;this&nbsp;month!&nbsp;How&nbsp;can&nbsp;you&nbsp;capture&nbsp;an&nbsp;eye?&nbsp;You&nbsp;can&nbsp;try&nbsp;this&nbsp;literally&nbsp;with&nbsp;interesting&nbsp;ways&nbsp;to&nbsp;frame&nbsp;one&#39;s&nbsp;eye(s)&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;portrait&nbsp;or&nbsp;more&nbsp;indirectly&nbsp;by&nbsp;finding&nbsp;eye&nbsp;shapes&nbsp;or&nbsp;patterns&nbsp;in&nbsp;nature&nbsp;or&nbsp;architecture.&nbsp;Maybe&nbsp;you&nbsp;go&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;more&nbsp;symbolic&nbsp;route&nbsp;🤔&nbsp;Get&nbsp;creative&nbsp;and&nbsp;share&nbsp;your&nbsp;photos!</p>	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/challenges/fa926f0a-38bb-4ed1-9cfc-1841c37113a8.jpg	U7JHEeE{00~q00-;%2MJ1Pt4R%o}OGjZ%1j=	1280	858	2026-02-03 00:00:00+00	\N	2026-02-03 17:54:13.662+00	bb1f198b-0f2a-452c-875b-23b8b949af4e	t	2026-02-03 13:48:03.765515+00	2026-02-03 13:48:03.765515+00	\N	f	\N
bfba2629-eb69-431f-ad1a-6ef53b9a88ca	color-challenge-february-2026	Color challenge - February 2026	<p>Each&nbsp;participant&nbsp;picks&nbsp;one&nbsp;color&nbsp;(or&nbsp;gets&nbsp;one&nbsp;assigned)&nbsp;and&nbsp;goes&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;walk&nbsp;-&nbsp;be&nbsp;it&nbsp;alone&nbsp;or&nbsp;together&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;group,&nbsp;looking&nbsp;for&nbsp;subjects&nbsp;where&nbsp;that&nbsp;color&nbsp;clearly&nbsp;stands&nbsp;out.&nbsp;The&nbsp;goal&nbsp;is&nbsp;to&nbsp;make&nbsp;at&nbsp;least&nbsp;three&nbsp;to&nbsp;nine&nbsp;photos&nbsp;that&nbsp;work&nbsp;together&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;small&nbsp;series.&nbsp;This&nbsp;challenge&nbsp;is&nbsp;about&nbsp;training&nbsp;your&nbsp;eye,&nbsp;improving&nbsp;composition,&nbsp;and&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;more&nbsp;aware&nbsp;of&nbsp;color&nbsp;in&nbsp;everyday&nbsp;scenes.&nbsp;Any&nbsp;camera&nbsp;is&nbsp;welcome.&nbsp;Let&#39;s&nbsp;have&nbsp;fun!&nbsp;Submit&nbsp;one&nbsp;collage&nbsp;(3,&nbsp;6&nbsp;or&nbsp;9&nbsp;photos)&nbsp;with&nbsp;your&nbsp;assigned&nbsp;color.</p>	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/challenges/1f621ef5-4037-4e6b-9fc5-9790f4aef009.jpg	UQG[g4r^9@Os.AoNY4out8r=Xzf|={#,oaKN	2048	1466	2026-02-28 00:00:00+00	2026-04-30 00:00:00+00	\N	36ae98cf-e596-4157-8eb7-4391c5292b7f	t	2026-02-28 03:26:30.867856+00	2026-02-28 03:26:30.867856+00	3	t	28-02-2026
ef9941f8-502e-4335-8e1c-17fee8b8e6a1	march-2026-liminal	March 2026 - liminal	<p>Feelings&nbsp;of&nbsp;unease,&nbsp;unreal,&nbsp;or&nbsp;transition&nbsp;-&nbsp;all&nbsp;of&nbsp;this&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;incorporated&nbsp;into&nbsp;visualizing&nbsp;liminal&nbsp;spaces.&nbsp;</p><p>We&#39;re&nbsp;all&nbsp;looking&nbsp;forward&nbsp;to&nbsp;sunny&nbsp;weather&nbsp;for&nbsp;photo&nbsp;walks&nbsp;but&nbsp;don&#39;t&nbsp;underestimate&nbsp;how&nbsp;much&nbsp;fun&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;still&nbsp;have&nbsp;in&nbsp;grey&nbsp;weather&nbsp;or&nbsp;making&nbsp;use&nbsp;of&nbsp;indoor&nbsp;spaces.</p><p>Have&nbsp;fun!</p>	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/challenges/5caa446d-d8ac-4f7a-ab50-b09af32b5776.jpg	U[IE*1ofWCof~Wofayof%2j[j[j[WBayfQfQ	1287	1920	2026-03-01 17:35:05.91+00	\N	\N	bb1f198b-0f2a-452c-875b-23b8b949af4e	t	2026-03-01 17:35:04.635042+00	2026-03-01 17:35:04.635042+00	\N	f	\N
a763ab66-2a49-4a3c-92d5-0a4eb1d5f30e	frames	Frames	<p>Monthly&nbsp;challenges&nbsp;are&nbsp;back!&nbsp;After&nbsp;a&nbsp;little&nbsp;summer&nbsp;pause,&nbsp;we&#39;ll&nbsp;get&nbsp;back&nbsp;to&nbsp;giving&nbsp;some&nbsp;monthly&nbsp;inspiration.</p><p>Have&nbsp;you&nbsp;ever&nbsp;gone&nbsp;through&nbsp;a&nbsp;lot&nbsp;of&nbsp;trouble&nbsp;to&nbsp;get&nbsp;a&nbsp;picture&nbsp;with&nbsp;nothing&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;way?&nbsp;Some&nbsp;tree&nbsp;branches,&nbsp;people,&nbsp;buildings.&nbsp;Maybe&nbsp;you&nbsp;don&#39;t&nbsp;always&nbsp;have&nbsp;to!</p><p>Play&nbsp;around&nbsp;with&nbsp;using&nbsp;the&nbsp;foreground&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;way&nbsp;to&nbsp;frame&nbsp;your&nbsp;picture.&nbsp;Windows,&nbsp;trees,&nbsp;anything&nbsp;that&nbsp;creates&nbsp;a&nbsp;&quot;frame&quot;&nbsp;within&nbsp;the&nbsp;picture,&nbsp;use&nbsp;a&nbsp;&quot;busy&quot;&nbsp;or&nbsp;messy&nbsp;situation&nbsp;to&nbsp;your&nbsp;benefit.</p><p>Have&nbsp;fun!</p>	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/challenges/370d16eb-428c-4d4b-a197-c440a474fd5e.jpg	U9C?fWpI009Fbf9aDiRi4.xa-;xu00-V~q%M	2075	3130	2026-09-04 00:00:00+00	\N	\N	bb1f198b-0f2a-452c-875b-23b8b949af4e	t	2026-09-04 12:26:32.180129+00	2026-09-04 12:26:32.180129+00	\N	f	\N
