COPY public.events (id, title, description, date, "time", location, cover_image, rsvp_count, created_at, image_blurhash, image_width, image_height, max_attendees, slug, rsvp_reminder_sent_at, attendee_reminder_sent_at, is_draft) FROM stdin;
9	Shadow & Light - Walk to the Japanese Garden	This month we're going to have more of a group excursion to enjoy the nice weather. We're going to meet together at the D.E cafe near Den Haag Centraal and then explore the city together, ending at the Japanese garden.	2025-05-31	13:00:00	DE Cafe New Babylon\nAnna van Buerenplein 3\nDen Haag	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/event-9.jpeg	0	2026-01-05 16:26:12.767679+00	U7C?Jl%%0MDO9-pI-i+@~q.8s+nLlAI_-OIU	1280	720	\N	shadow-light-japanese-garden-2025-05-31	\N	\N	f
8	Mini Meetup: Kralingse Bos	Let's explore more of Kralingse Bos together! We'll be starting the walk from De Ster (the windmill) and we'll be doing a counter clockwise circle through the park. Very relaxed pace, perfect for photography.	2025-05-10	13:00:00	Plaszoom at The windmill (De ster)\nKralingse Bos\nRotterdam	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/event-8.jpeg	0	2026-01-05 16:26:12.703404+00	UpDmp=t6WFo#yZR*oyoz%ij]WVbHR*bIWDWB	2048	1151	\N	mini-meetup-kralingse-bos-2025-05-10	\N	\N	f
7	Nature/Wildlife Photography & Walk around Kralingse Bos	Spring is here and we want to take full advantage of the nice weather! We'll gather at restaurant De Tuin in Kralingse Bos and Murtada will give a short photography talk. Afterwards, we'll explore the park together for a photo walk.	2025-04-19	13:00:00	Restaurant de Tuin\nPlaszoom 354\nRotterdam	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/event-7.jpeg	0	2026-01-05 16:26:12.64767+00	UbI5-[t7InbIyGWCbIbHx^ofofWr?wWCa}a}	1120	630	\N	nature-wildlife-photography-kralingse-bos-2025-04-19	\N	\N	f
6	Photo Share & Walk around Het Park	For March we want to have an open "photo share" day. Pick out one photo (or a small series) that you'd like to share with the group! You can ask for feedback, share the story behind it, or simply show off your work.	2025-03-29	13:00:00	The Tea Lab\nNieuwe Binnenweg 178 A\nRotterdam	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/event-6.jpeg	0	2026-01-05 16:26:12.589293+00	UxH_GPM_W=nh~WV@ofV@%MofWCV@s:t7WBWB	2560	1440	\N	photo-share-walk-het-park-2025-03-29	\N	\N	f
11	Rotterdam Summer Carnival Photo Walk	Join us for a vibrant photo walk through the heart of Rotterdam during the legendary Summer Carnival street parade — a dazzling celebration of color, music, and culture. We'll capture the energy and excitement together.	2025-07-26	13:00:00	Willem de Kooning Academie\nBlaak 10\nRotterdam	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/event-11.jpeg	0	2026-01-05 16:26:12.877142+00	UIIqx]_M.S%FGF.lXgJ6D%s;RPx]?JrE^l-C	1920	1080	\N	rotterdam-summer-carnival-photo-walk-2025-07-26	\N	\N	f
10	Robert's Experiences at Kodak	At this meetup, Robert will be giving a talk about his time at Kodak. After graduating from university, he began his career there and eventually joined the Government Systems Division. Join us for fascinating insights into the world of film photography.	2025-06-28	13:00:00	The Tea Lab\nNieuwe Binnenweg 178 A\nRotterdam	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/event-10.jpeg	0	2026-01-05 16:26:12.821353+00	UxH_GPM_W=nh~WV@ofV@%MofWCV@s:t7WBWB	2560	1440	\N	roberts-experiences-kodak-2025-06-28	\N	\N	f
16	2025 Recap	For this meetup, we'd like to share a little recap and some highlights from 2025. We will collect some photos from the past photo challenges and meetups to share how everyone has grown and what we've accomplished together as a community.	2025-12-27	13:00:00	The Tea Lab\nNieuwe Binnenweg 178 A\nRotterdam	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/event-16.jpeg	0	2026-01-05 16:26:13.14989+00	UEFOr-tmj[-;_NZ~9ZInx]X9n$s,4nM{xZxu	2560	1440	\N	2025-recap-2025-12-27	\N	\N	f
14	Surreal Photography	Let's explore October's photo challenge prompt together! Often some people express trying to capture moments perfectly - either as they looked in real life or an idealized version. This month we embrace imperfection and see where it takes us creatively.	2025-10-25	13:00:00	The Tea Lab\nNieuwe Binnenweg 178 A\nRotterdam	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/event-14.jpeg	0	2026-01-05 16:26:13.040465+00	U+G*4+xabbof~Ct7kCof-pozkCkCxuogbbj]	1280	720	\N	surreal-photography-2025-10-25	\N	\N	f
13	Photoshare: Summer Recap!	Summer is coming to an end. Many of you have been traveling and exploring (locally and abroad) or just going out to take photos more often during the nice weather, so we thought it would be great to have a meetup to share our summer photography!	2025-09-27	13:00:00	The Tea Lab\nNieuwe Binnenweg 178 A\nRotterdam	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/event-13.jpeg	0	2026-01-05 16:26:12.985762+00	UQH-+69FtRD$~8S5xu%M?b%2M{oI_3RixtNG	2560	1440	\N	photoshare-summer-recap-2025-09-27	\N	\N	f
