20	Nederlands Fotomuseum - Group visit	<p>We&#39;re&nbsp;planning&nbsp;a&nbsp;group&nbsp;visit&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;Dutch&nbsp;Photo&nbsp;Museum&nbsp;(Nederlands&nbsp;Fotomuseum)&nbsp;in&nbsp;Rotterdam.&nbsp;This&nbsp;museum&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;national&nbsp;museum&nbsp;for&nbsp;photography&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;Netherlands&nbsp;and&nbsp;is&nbsp;known&nbsp;for&nbsp;its&nbsp;rich&nbsp;collection&nbsp;of&nbsp;both&nbsp;historical&nbsp;and&nbsp;contemporary&nbsp;work.&nbsp;With&nbsp;millions&nbsp;of&nbsp;images&nbsp;in&nbsp;its&nbsp;archive,&nbsp;it&nbsp;shows&nbsp;how&nbsp;photography&nbsp;has&nbsp;shaped&nbsp;the&nbsp;way&nbsp;we&nbsp;look&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;world.</p><p>This&nbsp;visit&nbsp;is&nbsp;extra&nbsp;special&nbsp;because&nbsp;the&nbsp;museum&nbsp;is&nbsp;reopening&nbsp;in&nbsp;its&nbsp;stunning&nbsp;new&nbsp;home&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;Santos&nbsp;warehouse&nbsp;on&nbsp;Rotterdam’s&nbsp;Rijnhaven&nbsp;on&nbsp;7&nbsp;February&nbsp;2026.&nbsp;The&nbsp;renovated&nbsp;landmark&nbsp;building&nbsp;will&nbsp;offer&nbsp;a&nbsp;fresh&nbsp;way&nbsp;to&nbsp;experience&nbsp;photography,&nbsp;with&nbsp;exhibitions,&nbsp;studios,&nbsp;a&nbsp;photo&nbsp;book&nbsp;library,&nbsp;a&nbsp;darkroom,&nbsp;and&nbsp;social&nbsp;spaces&nbsp;for&nbsp;everyone&nbsp;to&nbsp;enjoy.</p><p>We&#39;ll&nbsp;go&nbsp;together&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;group&nbsp;but&nbsp;you&#39;re&nbsp;free&nbsp;to&nbsp;explore&nbsp;separately!&nbsp;It&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;a&nbsp;great&nbsp;chance&nbsp;for&nbsp;us&nbsp;to&nbsp;explore&nbsp;inspiring&nbsp;work&nbsp;together,&nbsp;talk&nbsp;about&nbsp;what&nbsp;we&nbsp;see,&nbsp;and&nbsp;simply&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;a&nbsp;shared&nbsp;photography&nbsp;experience&nbsp;in&nbsp;person.&nbsp;Let&#39;s&nbsp;make&nbsp;an&nbsp;afternoon&nbsp;of&nbsp;it!</p><p>PS.&nbsp;Make&nbsp;sure&nbsp;to&nbsp;buy&nbsp;your&nbsp;ticket&nbsp;beforehand!</p>	2026-02-14	13:00:00	Pakhuis Santos (Nederlands Fotomuseum)\nBrede Hilledijk 95\nRotterdam	https://db.creativephotography.group/stora