21	Color photography challenge	<p>Join&nbsp;us&nbsp;for&nbsp;today&#39;s&nbsp;meetup&nbsp;where&nbsp;we&#39;ll&nbsp;do&nbsp;a&nbsp;Color&nbsp;Photography&nbsp;Challenge,&nbsp;a&nbsp;popular&nbsp;photography&nbsp;exercise&nbsp;often&nbsp;also&nbsp;called&nbsp;a&nbsp;Color&nbsp;Walk.</p><p>Each&nbsp;participant&nbsp;picks&nbsp;one&nbsp;color&nbsp;(or&nbsp;gets&nbsp;one&nbsp;assigned)&nbsp;and&nbsp;goes&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;walk&nbsp;-&nbsp;be&nbsp;it&nbsp;alone&nbsp;or&nbsp;together&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;group,&nbsp;looking&nbsp;for&nbsp;subjects&nbsp;where&nbsp;that&nbsp;color&nbsp;clearly&nbsp;stands&nbsp;out.&nbsp;The&nbsp;goal&nbsp;is&nbsp;to&nbsp;make&nbsp;at&nbsp;least&nbsp;three&nbsp;to&nbsp;nine&nbsp;photos&nbsp;that&nbsp;work&nbsp;together&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;small&nbsp;series.</p><p>This&nbsp;challenge&nbsp;is&nbsp;about&nbsp;training&nbsp;your&nbsp;eye,&nbsp;improving&nbsp;composition,&nbsp;and&nbsp;becoming&nbsp;more&nbsp;aware&nbsp;of&nbsp;color&nbsp;in&nbsp;everyday&nbsp;scenes.&nbsp;Any&nbsp;camera&nbsp;is&nbsp;welcome.&nbsp;Let&#39;s&nbsp;have&nbsp;fun!&nbsp;We&nbsp;will&nbsp;regroup&nbsp;afterwards&nbsp;to&nbsp;share&nbsp;and&nbsp;talk&nbsp;through&nbsp;what&nbsp;we&nbsp;found!</p><p>Tip:&nbsp;After&nbsp;the&nbsp;walk,&nbsp;share&nbsp;your&nbsp;photos&nbsp;here&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;platform.&nbsp;Posting&nbsp;your&nbsp;series&nbsp;here&nbsp;helps&nbsp;you&nbsp;get&nbsp;feedback,&nbsp;see&nbsp;how&nbsp;others&nbsp;approached&nbsp;the&nbsp;same&nbsp;challenge,&nbsp;and&nbsp;build&nbsp;a&nbsp;shared&nbsp;archive&nbsp;of&nbsp;work&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;meetup.&nbsp;Sign&nbsp;up,&nbsp;shoot&nbsp;your&nbsp;color,&nbsp;and&nbsp;add&nbsp;your&nbsp;photos&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;group!</p><p>Submit&nbsp;your&nbsp;photos&nbsp;here:&nbsp;<a href=" https://creativephotography.group/challenges/color-challenge-february-2026" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Color&nbsp;Challenge&nbsp;-&nbsp;February&nbsp;2026</a></p>	2026-02-28	13:00:00	Schot Coffee Roasters\nPelgrimsstraat 5c\nRotterdam	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/4f1bb83a-3325-4ea5-8fbf-85a6ee07f5dd.jpg	0	2026-02-07 20:38:28.069596+00	UYMHc7-;-F%M~Xofa~j]=%xuI-jbNrs:ofoy	1920	1080	\N	color-photography-challenge	\N	\N	f
22	Spec it, Shoot it, Share it! (vol 2)	<p>This&nbsp;meetup&nbsp;is&nbsp;all&nbsp;about&nbsp;creativity,&nbsp;teamwork,&nbsp;and&nbsp;real-world&nbsp;practice.&nbsp;Inspired&nbsp;by&nbsp;a&nbsp;spec&nbsp;campaign&nbsp;project&nbsp;(like&nbsp;the&nbsp;one&nbsp;in&nbsp;<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ldtGs4A-N5Y" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">this&nbsp;video</a>),&nbsp;we&#39;ll&nbsp;be&nbsp;working&nbsp;in&nbsp;small&nbsp;groups&nbsp;to&nbsp;concept&nbsp;and&nbsp;shoot&nbsp;a&nbsp;mini&nbsp;brand&nbsp;or&nbsp;product&nbsp;campaign&nbsp;—&nbsp;even&nbsp;if&nbsp;the&nbsp;brand&nbsp;doesn’t&nbsp;know&nbsp;it&nbsp;yet.</p><p>The&nbsp;idea?&nbsp;<strong>Spec&nbsp;work</strong>.&nbsp;You’re&nbsp;creating&nbsp;a&nbsp;set&nbsp;of&nbsp;photos&nbsp;as&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;were&nbsp;hired&nbsp;to&nbsp;shoot&nbsp;a&nbsp;campaign.&nbsp;This&nbsp;is&nbsp;something&nbsp;professionals&nbsp;and&nbsp;aspiring&nbsp;photographers&nbsp;alike&nbsp;do&nbsp;to&nbsp;build&nbsp;portfolios,&nbsp;explore&nbsp;creative&nbsp;ideas,&nbsp;and&nbsp;show&nbsp;the&nbsp;kind&nbsp;of&nbsp;work&nbsp;they&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;hired&nbsp;for.</p><p><strong>The&nbsp;exercise</strong></p><p><strong>1.&nbsp;Come&nbsp;prepared:</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Think&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;product&nbsp;or&nbsp;brand&nbsp;yourself</strong></p><ul><li>Real&nbsp;or&nbsp;made-up:&nbsp;something&nbsp;you’d&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;photographing</li><li>Bring&nbsp;props&nbsp;or&nbsp;gear&nbsp;if&nbsp;it&nbsp;helps&nbsp;bring&nbsp;the&nbsp;idea&nbsp;to&nbsp;life</li><li>Need&nbsp;inspiration?&nbsp;<a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HK0D-K4rIV3gMNY9EK0rZtJiM7wK1-JfUzorsLubLgI/edit?usp=sharing" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Check&nbsp;out&nbsp;this&nbsp;list&nbsp;here</a>!</li></ul><p><strong>2.&nbsp;During&nbsp;the&nbsp;meetup:&nbsp;Form&nbsp;small&nbsp;teams</strong>&nbsp;(3–5&nbsp;people)</p><p><strong>3.&nbsp;Pitch&nbsp;your&nbsp;idea&nbsp;to&nbsp;your&nbsp;group</strong></p><ul><li>Vote&nbsp;or&nbsp;mix&nbsp;ideas&nbsp;to&nbsp;choose&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>campaign</strong>&nbsp;concept</li><li>You&nbsp;will&nbsp;work&nbsp;out&nbsp;at&nbsp;least&nbsp;<strong>one&nbsp;idea</strong>&nbsp;in&nbsp;your&nbsp;group</li></ul><p><strong>4.&nbsp;Brainstorm&nbsp;a&nbsp;simple&nbsp;campaign&nbsp;concept</strong></p><ul><li>Think&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;mood,&nbsp;message&nbsp;and&nbsp;aesthetic</li><li>Optionally:&nbsp;create&nbsp;a&nbsp;mini&nbsp;moodboard&nbsp;or&nbsp;sketch&nbsp;a&nbsp;few&nbsp;shot&nbsp;ideas&nbsp;first</li></ul><p><strong>5.&nbsp;Go&nbsp;out&nbsp;there&nbsp;and&nbsp;shoot&nbsp;your&nbsp;campaign</strong></p><ul><li>You&nbsp;can&nbsp;use&nbsp;gear,&nbsp;props&nbsp;and&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;model&nbsp;amongst&nbsp;yourselves</li></ul><p><strong>6.&nbsp;Share&nbsp;your&nbsp;results&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;group</strong></p><ul><li>Take&nbsp;your&nbsp;photos,&nbsp;edit&nbsp;them,&nbsp;set&nbsp;them&nbsp;up&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;little&nbsp;presentation&nbsp;or&nbsp;PDF</li><li>Think&nbsp;about&nbsp;how&nbsp;you&nbsp;would&nbsp;present&nbsp;your&nbsp;work&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;client</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>What&nbsp;you&#39;ll&nbsp;practice</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Creative&nbsp;Direction</strong>:&nbsp;From&nbsp;idea&nbsp;to&nbsp;execution.</li><li><strong>Collaboration</strong>:&nbsp;Working&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;team&nbsp;under&nbsp;time&nbsp;and&nbsp;creative&nbsp;constraints.</li><li><strong>Portfolio&nbsp;Building</strong>:&nbsp;You&nbsp;walk&nbsp;away&nbsp;with&nbsp;new&nbsp;material.</li><li><strong>Shooting&nbsp;with&nbsp;Intent</strong>:&nbsp;Thinking&nbsp;like&nbsp;a&nbsp;brand&nbsp;photographer.</li><li><strong>Problem&nbsp;Solving</strong>:&nbsp;Working&nbsp;with&nbsp;what&nbsp;you&nbsp;have,&nbsp;where&nbsp;you&nbsp;are.</li></ul><p><strong>Join&nbsp;us&nbsp;to&nbsp;have&nbsp;a&nbsp;chance&nbsp;to&nbsp;share&nbsp;ideas,&nbsp;collaborate,&nbsp;and&nbsp;create&nbsp;something&nbsp;cool&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;group!&nbsp;📸</strong></p><p>🟣&nbsp;<strong><a href="https://discord.gg/cWQK8udb6p" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Discord</a></strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;announcements,&nbsp;photo&nbsp;challenges&nbsp;and&nbsp;discussions</p><p>🟢&nbsp;<strong><a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/Fg6az5H2NTP9unlhqoxQEf" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">WhatsApp</a></strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;meetup&nbsp;updates,&nbsp;practical&nbsp;info&nbsp;(join&nbsp;the&nbsp;&quot;general&quot;&nbsp;group),&nbsp;photo&nbsp;sharing</p><p>🟠&nbsp;<strong><a href="https://www.instagram.com/creativephotography.group" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Instagram</a></strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;photos,&nbsp;updates&nbsp;and&nbsp;networking</p>	2026-03-28	13:00:00	Schot Coffee Roasters\nPelgrimsstraat 5c\nRotterdam	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/d586766c-fa76-49a2-9afb-8f100d96b45f.jpg	0	2026-03-09 15:50:55.864402+00	UNIYk800?I~X%zNYogt7wiMzoyoyxIMytPbX	2000	1600	\N	spec-it-shoot-it-share-it-vol-2	\N	\N	f
23	Open feedback & Photo share	<p>This&nbsp;meetup&nbsp;is&nbsp;simple:&nbsp;bring&nbsp;some&nbsp;photos,&nbsp;put&nbsp;them&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;table&nbsp;(or&nbsp;show&nbsp;them&nbsp;on&nbsp;your&nbsp;device),&nbsp;and&nbsp;talk&nbsp;about&nbsp;them.&nbsp;Ask&nbsp;for&nbsp;feedback,&nbsp;share&nbsp;your&nbsp;thoughts&nbsp;on&nbsp;someone&nbsp;else&#39;s&nbsp;work,&nbsp;or&nbsp;just&nbsp;listen&nbsp;in.&nbsp;No&nbsp;structure,&nbsp;no&nbsp;pressure&nbsp;-&nbsp;just&nbsp;an&nbsp;open&nbsp;space&nbsp;to&nbsp;look,&nbsp;think,&nbsp;and&nbsp;chat&nbsp;about&nbsp;photography.</p><p>We’re&nbsp;switching&nbsp;it&nbsp;up&nbsp;this&nbsp;time&nbsp;and&nbsp;meeting&nbsp;on&nbsp;a&nbsp;<strong>Sunday</strong>&nbsp;at&nbsp;Schot&nbsp;Coffee&nbsp;Roasters.&nbsp;Come&nbsp;hang&nbsp;out!</p>	2026-04-26	13:00:00	Schot Coffee Roasters\nPelgrimsstraat 5c\nRotterdam	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/69931d85-40cc-43be-ba47-f0c3709cbf38.jpg	0	2026-04-05 18:14:49.264731+00	UTG8J[%MI;r=~Wg3NIt7tRS4RjxZ%2oLM{ni	1920	1268	\N	open-feedback-april-2026	\N	\N	f
30	Evening beach & dunes photo walk	<p>Lately&nbsp;the&nbsp;weather&#39;s&nbsp;been&nbsp;perfect&nbsp;for&nbsp;evening&nbsp;and&nbsp;sunset&nbsp;photography,&nbsp;so&nbsp;why&nbsp;not&nbsp;combine&nbsp;it&nbsp;with&nbsp;an&nbsp;amazing&nbsp;location:&nbsp;the&nbsp;beach!</p><p>We&#39;ll&nbsp;do&nbsp;a&nbsp;walk&nbsp;along&nbsp;the&nbsp;beach&nbsp;and&nbsp;throughout&nbsp;the&nbsp;dunes&nbsp;at&nbsp;Hoek&nbsp;van&nbsp;Holland,&nbsp;stopping&nbsp;at&nbsp;interesting&nbsp;locations&nbsp;(or&nbsp;whenever&nbsp;you&nbsp;feel&nbsp;like&nbsp;it).</p><p><strong>Plan:</strong></p><ul><li>Meet&nbsp;up&nbsp;at&nbsp;19:00&nbsp;around&nbsp;the&nbsp;metro&nbsp;station&nbsp;Hoek&nbsp;van&nbsp;Holland&nbsp;Strand.</li><li>Walk&nbsp;starts&nbsp;at&nbsp;19:15,&nbsp;group&nbsp;location&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;shared&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;WhatsApp&nbsp;group.</li><li>Meet&nbsp;back&nbsp;at&nbsp;21:30&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;same&nbsp;location.</li></ul><p>Feel&nbsp;free&nbsp;to&nbsp;walk&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;group&nbsp;or&nbsp;spread&nbsp;out/go&nbsp;at&nbsp;your&nbsp;own&nbsp;pace.</p><p><strong>Come&nbsp;prepared!</strong>&nbsp;Some&nbsp;things&nbsp;to&nbsp;consider&nbsp;bringing:</p><ul><li>Spare&nbsp;battery</li><li>Extra&nbsp;memory&nbsp;card</li><li>Tripod</li><li>Lens&nbsp;filters</li><li>Lens&nbsp;cloth</li><li>Something&nbsp;to&nbsp;keep&nbsp;yourself&nbsp;warm</li><li>Shoes&nbsp;you&nbsp;don&#39;t&nbsp;mind&nbsp;getting&nbsp;sandy</li><li>Small&nbsp;light&nbsp;or&nbsp;flashlight&nbsp;(could&nbsp;be&nbsp;fun&nbsp;for&nbsp;photos&nbsp;too!)</li><li>Maybe&nbsp;something&nbsp;to&nbsp;sit&nbsp;on</li><li>Water&nbsp;and&nbsp;snacks!</li></ul><p>See&nbsp;you&nbsp;there!&nbsp;🐚🌅</p>	2026-05-02	19:00:00	Hoek van Holland Strand\nBadweg 92\n3151 HA, Hook of Holland	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/abe77a1e-c438-4203-b768-67aa35868e73.jpg	0	2026-04-26 19:58:38.8973+00	UpGa]?RkIpoe~VWBNGoLx]axe.WXOsj?n$WV	2560	1180	\N	evening-beach-dunes-photo-walk	\N	\N	f
25	Walk to the Japanese Garden	<p>This&nbsp;month&nbsp;we&#39;re&nbsp;going&nbsp;to&nbsp;have&nbsp;more&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;group&nbsp;excursion&nbsp;to&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;the&nbsp;nice&nbsp;weather.&nbsp;We&#39;re&nbsp;going&nbsp;to&nbsp;meet&nbsp;together&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;D.E&nbsp;cafe&nbsp;near&nbsp;Den&nbsp;Haag&nbsp;Centraal&nbsp;and&nbsp;walk&nbsp;together&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;Japanese&nbsp;garden&nbsp;in&nbsp;Park&nbsp;Clingendael.&nbsp;</p><p>Let&#39;s&nbsp;mingle&nbsp;for&nbsp;30&nbsp;minutes&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;café&nbsp;and&nbsp;start&nbsp;the&nbsp;walk&nbsp;around&nbsp;12:30.&nbsp;We&#39;ll&nbsp;be&nbsp;walking&nbsp;through&nbsp;Haagse&nbsp;Bos,&nbsp;stopping&nbsp;whenever&nbsp;there&#39;s&nbsp;something&nbsp;to&nbsp;photograph!</p><p>Bring&nbsp;something&nbsp;to&nbsp;drink&nbsp;and&nbsp;maybe&nbsp;some&nbsp;snacks&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;walk.&nbsp;There&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;restaurant&nbsp;(IJgenweis&nbsp;Food&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Drink)&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;park&nbsp;for&nbsp;when&nbsp;we&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;sit&nbsp;down&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;bit.</p><p><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/EQTLrpCX7wMcpNQh8" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">View&nbsp;photowalk&nbsp;route</a></p>	2026-05-30	12:00:00	DE Cafe New Babylon\nAnna van Buerenplein 3\nDen Haag	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/81c2e951-992b-49f7-9200-21ec0d70a011.jpg	0	2026-04-05 18:15:20.619629+00	UGC6uYIo4raj~nNZIDV{xtIpRjt6xunPWBtQ	2560	1707	\N	walk-to-the-japanese-garden-2026	\N	\N	f
26	Photowalk Broekpolder	<p>This&nbsp;month&nbsp;we&#39;re&nbsp;keeping&nbsp;things&nbsp;in&nbsp;nature&nbsp;and&nbsp;showing&nbsp;you&nbsp;around&nbsp;Broekpolder&nbsp;-&nbsp;a&nbsp;huge&nbsp;green&nbsp;escape&nbsp;right&nbsp;next&nbsp;to&nbsp;Vlaardingen.&nbsp;Expect&nbsp;open&nbsp;landscapes,&nbsp;winding&nbsp;paths,&nbsp;wildlife,&nbsp;and&nbsp;plenty&nbsp;of&nbsp;spots&nbsp;to&nbsp;shoot&nbsp;along&nbsp;the&nbsp;way.&nbsp;It&#39;s&nbsp;the&nbsp;kind&nbsp;of&nbsp;place&nbsp;where&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;slow&nbsp;down&nbsp;a&nbsp;bit,&nbsp;explore,&nbsp;and&nbsp;just&nbsp;see&nbsp;what&nbsp;catches&nbsp;your&nbsp;eye.</p><p>You&nbsp;might&nbsp;also&nbsp;run&nbsp;into&nbsp;the&nbsp;Scottish&nbsp;Highlanders.&nbsp;Those&nbsp;big,&nbsp;shaggy,&nbsp;red-haired&nbsp;cows&nbsp;that&nbsp;roam&nbsp;freely&nbsp;through&nbsp;the&nbsp;area.&nbsp;They&nbsp;make&nbsp;for&nbsp;some&nbsp;great&nbsp;subjects&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;keep&nbsp;a&nbsp;bit&nbsp;of&nbsp;distance&nbsp;and&nbsp;take&nbsp;your&nbsp;time.</p><p>We&#39;ll&nbsp;start&nbsp;together&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;McCafé&nbsp;and&nbsp;make&nbsp;our&nbsp;way&nbsp;into&nbsp;the&nbsp;park&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;group&nbsp;before&nbsp;kicking&nbsp;off&nbsp;the&nbsp;walk.&nbsp;There&#39;s&nbsp;no&nbsp;rush.&nbsp;We&#39;ll&nbsp;take&nbsp;breaks,&nbsp;wander,&nbsp;and&nbsp;there&#39;ll&nbsp;be&nbsp;space&nbsp;to&nbsp;shoot,&nbsp;chat,&nbsp;and&nbsp;explore&nbsp;at&nbsp;your&nbsp;own&nbsp;pace.</p><h3>Schedule</h3><ul><li>13:00&nbsp;—&nbsp;Meet&nbsp;at&nbsp;McCafé&nbsp;(Westlandseweg&nbsp;280)</li><li>13:15&nbsp;—&nbsp;Walk&nbsp;towards&nbsp;the&nbsp;park&nbsp;(±10&nbsp;min)</li><li>13:25&nbsp;—&nbsp;Start&nbsp;the&nbsp;photo&nbsp;walk</li><li>16:00&nbsp;—&nbsp;Walk&nbsp;back&nbsp;together</li></ul><h3>Routes</h3><p>Check&nbsp;out&nbsp;the:&nbsp;<a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/6sFkFJ9fV9xLNMrU8" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">walking&nbsp;route</a>.</p><p>To&nbsp;get&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;McCafé,&nbsp;the&nbsp;best&nbsp;option&nbsp;is&nbsp;to&nbsp;take&nbsp;Metro&nbsp;line&nbsp;B&nbsp;to&nbsp;Vlaardingen&nbsp;Oost,&nbsp;and&nbsp;then&nbsp;take&nbsp;Bus&nbsp;156&nbsp;to&nbsp;Vlaardingen&nbsp;west.&nbsp;Get&nbsp;off&nbsp;at&nbsp;bus&nbsp;stop&nbsp;&quot;Floreslaan&quot;.&nbsp;See&nbsp;the:&nbsp;<a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/sTofdaABZNNygnSh8" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">travel&nbsp;route</a>.</p>	2026-06-27	13:00:00	McCafé\nWestlandseweg 280\n3131 HX Vlaardingen	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/8d4a218e-b5f6-4628-b6d0-23c78d47610a.jpg	0	2026-04-05 18:16:04.533599+00	UTFh@ORQs,-:~VD*k9%Lx]I:R*s:n-xEaLkB	2560	1440	\N	walk-around-broekpolder	\N	\N	f
27	Photowalk Kralingse Plas	<p>This&nbsp;time&nbsp;we&#39;re&nbsp;heading&nbsp;to&nbsp;Kralingse&nbsp;Plas&nbsp;-&nbsp;one&nbsp;of&nbsp;Rotterdam&#39;s&nbsp;nicest&nbsp;spots&nbsp;to&nbsp;take&nbsp;photos.&nbsp;Think&nbsp;open&nbsp;water,&nbsp;skyline&nbsp;views,&nbsp;quiet&nbsp;forest&nbsp;paths,&nbsp;and&nbsp;plenty&nbsp;of&nbsp;variety&nbsp;in&nbsp;one&nbsp;walk.</p><p>We&#39;ll&nbsp;start&nbsp;an&nbsp;hour&nbsp;earlier&nbsp;with&nbsp;lunch&nbsp;at&nbsp;De&nbsp;Tuin&nbsp;van&nbsp;de&nbsp;Vier&nbsp;Windstreken,&nbsp;right&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;water.</p><p>Then&nbsp;head&nbsp;out&nbsp;together&nbsp;and&nbsp;circle&nbsp;the&nbsp;lake&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;group.&nbsp;Easy&nbsp;pace,&nbsp;good&nbsp;company,&nbsp;and&nbsp;lots&nbsp;of&nbsp;beautiful&nbsp;nature&nbsp;to&nbsp;work&nbsp;with.</p>	2026-07-18	12:00:00	Restaurant de Tuin\nPlaszoom 354\n3062 CL Rotterdam	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/69250c90-a1d6-4284-b294-002bf6bf6941.jpg	0	2026-04-05 18:16:40.007212+00	U4A0p+}11G0f?T-nn-OTO*Ios8M{0|57Vt=y	2560	1440	\N	photowalk-kralingse-plas	\N	\N	f
31	Solar eclipse photography 2026	<p>On&nbsp;August&nbsp;12th&nbsp;we&#39;re&nbsp;heading&nbsp;to&nbsp;Hoek&nbsp;van&nbsp;Holland&nbsp;for&nbsp;something&nbsp;rare:&nbsp;a&nbsp;partial&nbsp;solar&nbsp;eclipse,&nbsp;with&nbsp;over&nbsp;90%&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;sun&nbsp;covered&nbsp;at&nbsp;its&nbsp;peak.</p><p>We&#39;ll&nbsp;meet&nbsp;up&nbsp;before&nbsp;it&nbsp;starts&nbsp;so&nbsp;everyone&nbsp;can&nbsp;get&nbsp;set,&nbsp;talk&nbsp;through&nbsp;settings,&nbsp;and&nbsp;explore&nbsp;ideas&nbsp;together.&nbsp;Then&nbsp;we&#39;ll&nbsp;shoot&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;group&nbsp;as&nbsp;the&nbsp;light&nbsp;slowly&nbsp;shifts&nbsp;into&nbsp;that&nbsp;late-evening&nbsp;eclipse&nbsp;glow.&nbsp;The&nbsp;total&nbsp;duration&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;about&nbsp;2&nbsp;hours.</p><p>With&nbsp;nothing&nbsp;but&nbsp;the&nbsp;open&nbsp;sea&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;horizon,&nbsp;we&#39;ve&nbsp;got&nbsp;a&nbsp;clear,&nbsp;unobstructed&nbsp;view&nbsp;-&nbsp;hopefully&nbsp;some&nbsp;perfect&nbsp;conditions&nbsp;to&nbsp;really&nbsp;focus&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;sky&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;changing&nbsp;light.</p><p>Bring&nbsp;your&nbsp;gear,&nbsp;any&nbsp;(ND-)filters&nbsp;you&#39;ve&nbsp;got,&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;bit&nbsp;of&nbsp;patience.&nbsp;The&nbsp;hosts&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;there&nbsp;to&nbsp;assist&nbsp;you&nbsp;with&nbsp;your&nbsp;photography&nbsp;and&nbsp;questions.</p><p>Check&nbsp;out&nbsp;the&nbsp;animation&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;expected&nbsp;solar&nbsp;eclipse&nbsp;here:</p><p><a href="https://www.timeanddate.com/eclipse/in/@2754007?iso=20260812" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">https://www.timeanddate.com/eclipse/in/@2754007?iso=20260812</a></p><p>Note:&nbsp;More&nbsp;info&nbsp;about&nbsp;gear&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;posted&nbsp;here&nbsp;later.</p>	2026-08-12	19:00:00	Hoek van Holland Park\nBadweg 98\n3151 HA Hoek van Holland	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/ab94667b-378c-4717-9fcc-65063cf9c151.jpg	0	2026-06-07 15:47:21.721738+00	U,KmqKt6WWs:~Ut6bHoeWXoej[j[R-bHayfQ	2560	1440	\N	solar-eclipse-photography-2026	\N	\N	f
29	Finding photography inspiration in Het Depot	<p>Let’s&nbsp;step&nbsp;outside&nbsp;photography&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;while&nbsp;and&nbsp;look&nbsp;for&nbsp;inspiration&nbsp;in&nbsp;other&nbsp;forms&nbsp;of&nbsp;art.</p><p>For&nbsp;this&nbsp;meetup,&nbsp;we’ll&nbsp;visit&nbsp;the&nbsp;museum&nbsp;Het&nbsp;Depot&nbsp;in&nbsp;Rotterdam.&nbsp;Rather&nbsp;than&nbsp;looking&nbsp;at&nbsp;photography&nbsp;itself,&nbsp;we’ll&nbsp;focus&nbsp;on&nbsp;different&nbsp;artistic&nbsp;mediums&nbsp;and&nbsp;formats:&nbsp;paintings,&nbsp;sculptures,&nbsp;design,&nbsp;installations,&nbsp;and&nbsp;more.&nbsp;What&nbsp;can&nbsp;we&nbsp;take&nbsp;away&nbsp;from&nbsp;these&nbsp;different&nbsp;ways&nbsp;of&nbsp;creating&nbsp;and&nbsp;communicating&nbsp;visually?&nbsp;Can&nbsp;they&nbsp;change&nbsp;the&nbsp;way&nbsp;we&nbsp;approach&nbsp;our&nbsp;own&nbsp;photography?</p><p>We’ll&nbsp;wander&nbsp;through&nbsp;the&nbsp;museum,&nbsp;share&nbsp;observations,&nbsp;and&nbsp;see&nbsp;what&nbsp;sparks&nbsp;our&nbsp;imagination.&nbsp;Afterwards,&nbsp;we’ll&nbsp;head&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;restaurant&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;top&nbsp;floor&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;drink&nbsp;and&nbsp;discuss&nbsp;what&nbsp;we&nbsp;experienced,&nbsp;what&nbsp;stood&nbsp;out,&nbsp;and&nbsp;what&nbsp;we&nbsp;might&nbsp;take&nbsp;back&nbsp;into&nbsp;our&nbsp;photography.</p><p>🎟️&nbsp;<strong>Please&nbsp;note:</strong>&nbsp;everyone&nbsp;needs&nbsp;to&nbsp;purchase&nbsp;their&nbsp;own&nbsp;ticket&nbsp;in&nbsp;advance&nbsp;to&nbsp;enter&nbsp;Het&nbsp;Depot.&nbsp;A&nbsp;museum&nbsp;pass&nbsp;is&nbsp;also&nbsp;accepted.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.boijmans.nl/tickets-depot" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Get&nbsp;your&nbsp;tickets&nbsp;here</a>.</p>	2026-09-26	12:00:00	Het Depot\nMuseumpark 24\n3015 CX Rotterdam	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/d727cb48-23aa-4df4-ba0e-9e7a597dac7b.jpg	0	2026-04-05 18:17:38.68226+00	U8GI4Yhe00zp$B9@-:w1.9NGsnRicC$+RkNt	1150	780	\N	finding-photography-inspiration-in-het-depot	\N	\N	f
32	Workshop editing in Lightroom	<p>After&nbsp;many&nbsp;requests&nbsp;we&#39;re&nbsp;finally&nbsp;doing&nbsp;it:&nbsp;Our&nbsp;first&nbsp;online&nbsp;meetup&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;workshop:&nbsp;Editing&nbsp;in&nbsp;Lightroom!</p><p>Come&nbsp;hang&nbsp;out&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;group&nbsp;and&nbsp;learn&nbsp;what&nbsp;Murtada&#39;s&nbsp;editing&nbsp;flow&nbsp;looks&nbsp;like&nbsp;in&nbsp;Lightroom.&nbsp;From&nbsp;color&nbsp;grading&nbsp;to&nbsp;masking&nbsp;and&nbsp;presets&nbsp;-&nbsp;learn&nbsp;the&nbsp;tools&nbsp;to&nbsp;express&nbsp;your&nbsp;style&nbsp;in&nbsp;your&nbsp;photography.</p><p>The&nbsp;workshop&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;held&nbsp;online&nbsp;on&nbsp;our&nbsp;Discord&nbsp;server.&nbsp;We&nbsp;might&nbsp;also&nbsp;record&nbsp;the&nbsp;event&nbsp;for&nbsp;people&nbsp;who&nbsp;can&#39;t&nbsp;join.</p><p>Event&nbsp;link:&nbsp;<a href="https://discord.gg/aQ4CS89kp" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">https://discord.gg/aQ4CS89kp</a></p><p>See&nbsp;you&nbsp;then?</p>	2026-06-26	19:30:00	Online event\nDiscord	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/c8527050-3a5d-4671-9999-38f4b285386d.jpg	0	2026-06-20 14:20:16.360016+00	UHGuwK_2V@_3L4X9kDRj~B-pt7IU9bofs.t6	1920	1920	\N	workshop-editing-in-lightroom	\N	\N	f
28	Summer catch up and photo share	<p>Summer&nbsp;is&nbsp;slowly&nbsp;coming&nbsp;to&nbsp;an&nbsp;end&nbsp;and&nbsp;everyone’s&nbsp;been&nbsp;busy!&nbsp;Let’s&nbsp;slow&nbsp;it&nbsp;down,&nbsp;hang&nbsp;out&nbsp;together&nbsp;to&nbsp;catch&nbsp;up,&nbsp;share&nbsp;our&nbsp;photography,&nbsp;and&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;a&nbsp;relaxed&nbsp;afternoon&nbsp;together.</p><p>We&#39;ll&nbsp;meet&nbsp;up&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;first&nbsp;time&nbsp;at&nbsp;<a href="https://worm.org/spaces/wunderbar/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">#Wunderbar</a>&nbsp;in&nbsp;WORM,&nbsp;a&nbsp;creative&nbsp;meeting&nbsp;space&nbsp;in&nbsp;Rotterdam.</p><p>Come&nbsp;as&nbsp;you&nbsp;are,&nbsp;bring&nbsp;your&nbsp;camera&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;few&nbsp;photos&nbsp;to&nbsp;show,&nbsp;and&nbsp;let’s&nbsp;spend&nbsp;an&nbsp;afternoon&nbsp;together!</p>	2026-08-29	13:00:00	WORM\nBoomgaardsstraat 71\n3012 BN Rotterdam	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/events/9d826a86-bac8-4ade-b8a9-5b8be9759827.jpg	0	2026-04-05 18:17:13.168316+00	U~JHT~WBNGt7~VayV@of%MoejYazR.ofj[ae	2560	1707	\N	summer-catch-up-and-photo-share	\N	\N	f
