31896e37-4434-4086-81c9-445bebb8ff15	masterclass-dutch-masters-studio-photography-20260912	Masterclass: Dutch Masters Studio Photography	Master the art of light. In this Masterclass, you will dive deep into the principles of studio lighting and discover how different light shapers influence your image. By analysing the masterpieces of Rembrandt, Vermeer, and Jan Steen, you’ll learn how to translate classical techniques into modern (portrait) photography. Instructors Ymke Myrte and Dani'el van den Berg will provide hands-on tips and personalized feedback to refine your craft. Good to know: this masterclass is exclusively in English!	workshop	2026-09-12	\N	10:00:00	Cameranu Groningen	Groningen	Meeuwerderweg 8, 9724 ET	https://www.cameranu.nl/events/1131-masterclass-dutch-masters-studio-photography#event-5067	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/scene/31896e37-4434-4086-81c9-445bebb8ff15.jpg	U242M500V?_3%MM{oLxa00_4oL9YE2%MRjM{	410	230	Cameranu	€149 EUR	5a11a7c5-9296-4d7d-93ed-965bd493d192	\N	2026-03-12 06:29:28.973269+00	2026-03-12 14:00:44.604543+00	0	15:00:00
