ad446c85-3620-426a-9853-fa647bdfb41b	take-photos-of-portraits-and-miniature-world-20260404	Take photos of: Portraits and miniature world	<p><strong>Portrait&nbsp;photography&nbsp;with&nbsp;model&nbsp;in&nbsp;costume</strong></p><p>In&nbsp;the&nbsp;store,&nbsp;a&nbsp;setup&nbsp;was&nbsp;made&nbsp;to&nbsp;portray&nbsp;a&nbsp;real&nbsp;model.&nbsp;The&nbsp;model&nbsp;wears&nbsp;a&nbsp;costume&nbsp;and&nbsp;changes&nbsp;outfits&nbsp;during&nbsp;the&nbsp;day.&nbsp;Try&nbsp;to&nbsp;play&nbsp;with&nbsp;different&nbsp;exposures&nbsp;and&nbsp;experience&nbsp;what&nbsp;light&nbsp;does.&nbsp;We&nbsp;work&nbsp;with&nbsp;flashlight.&nbsp;Triggers&nbsp;are&nbsp;present.&nbsp;You&nbsp;can&nbsp;capture&nbsp;the&nbsp;model&nbsp;from&nbsp;10:00&nbsp;to&nbsp;11:00,&nbsp;12:00&nbsp;to&nbsp;13:00,&nbsp;14:00&nbsp;to&nbsp;15:00&nbsp;and&nbsp;from&nbsp;15:30&nbsp;to&nbsp;16:30.</p><p><strong>Photographing&nbsp;miniature&nbsp;dolls</strong></p><p>You&nbsp;photograph&nbsp;the&nbsp;little&nbsp;dolls&nbsp;so&nbsp;much&nbsp;as&nbsp;if&nbsp;they&nbsp;are&nbsp;really&nbsp;part&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;real&nbsp;world.&nbsp;The&nbsp;game&nbsp;is&nbsp;in&nbsp;perspective,&nbsp;scale&nbsp;and&nbsp;humor:&nbsp;everyday&nbsp;objects&nbsp;suddenly&nbsp;get&nbsp;a&nbsp;whole&nbsp;new&nbsp;story.&nbsp;This&nbsp;creative&nbsp;photography&nbsp;style&nbsp;has&nbsp;interfaces&nbsp;with&nbsp;macro&nbsp;photography&nbsp;and&nbsp;is&nbsp;often&nbsp;playful&nbsp;or&nbsp;funny,&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;lot&nbsp;of&nbsp;attention&nbsp;to&nbsp;composition&nbsp;and&nbsp;sharpness.&nbsp;In&nbsp;short:&nbsp;it&nbsp;is&nbsp;storytelling&nbsp;with&nbsp;mini-people&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;maxi&nbsp;world.&nbsp;On&nbsp;a&nbsp;table&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;store&nbsp;are&nbsp;2&nbsp;settings&nbsp;with&nbsp;miniature&nbsp;dolls.&nbsp;These&nbsp;settings&nbsp;change&nbsp;a&nbsp;number&nbsp;of&nbsp;times&nbsp;so&nbsp;that&nbsp;there&nbsp;are&nbsp;a&nbsp;total&nbsp;of&nbsp;six&nbsp;different&nbsp;setups.</p><p><strong>Program</strong></p><ul><li>10:00-12:30&nbsp;1st&nbsp;session&nbsp;Little&nbsp;People</li><li>10:00-11:00&nbsp;Portrait&nbsp;Photography</li><li>12:00-13:00&nbsp;Portrait&nbsp;Photography</li><li>12:30-14:00&nbsp;2nd&nbsp;Session&nbsp;Little&nbsp;People</li><li>14:00-15:00&nbsp;Portrait&nbsp;Photography</li><li>14:00-17:00&nbsp;3rd&nbsp;session&nbsp;Little&nbsp;People</li><li>15:30-16:30&nbsp;Portrait&nbsp;Photography</li></ul>	workshop	2026-04-04	\N	10:00:00	Cameranu Rotterdam	Rotterdam	Vierhavensstraat 29 , 3029 BB	https://www.cameranu.nl/events/1113-zelf-fotograferen-miniatuurwereld-en-portetten	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/scene/ad446c85-3620-426a-9853-fa647bdfb41b.png	UNQ+~m%Mxu%N?cj[fRj[_NogM{kB_4ofayof	640	337	FotoUnie Tilburg	\N	36ae98cf-e596-4157-8eb7-4391c5292b7f	\N	2026-03-10 22:45:53.411342+00	2026-03-11 00:21:56.87302+00	1	17:00:00
