97144351-162a-4f5f-bd3b-5c278f77d799	unseen-book-market-20260327	Unseen Book Market	<p>In&nbsp;the&nbsp;museum&#39;s&nbsp;entrance&nbsp;hall,&nbsp;some&nbsp;35&nbsp;publishers&nbsp;and&nbsp;specialist&nbsp;booksellers&nbsp;will&nbsp;present&nbsp;their&nbsp;latest&nbsp;and&nbsp;finest&nbsp;photography&nbsp;publications,&nbsp;including&nbsp;participants&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;Fw:Books,&nbsp;Kehrer&nbsp;Verlag,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Hannibal&nbsp;Books,&nbsp;and&nbsp;academies&nbsp;like&nbsp;the&nbsp;Willem&nbsp;de&nbsp;Kooning&nbsp;Academy&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;Royal&nbsp;Academy&nbsp;of&nbsp;Art&nbsp;(KABK).&nbsp;This&nbsp;year&#39;s&nbsp;Unseen&nbsp;Book&nbsp;Market&nbsp;boasts&nbsp;an&nbsp;exceptionally&nbsp;international&nbsp;character,&nbsp;with&nbsp;participants&nbsp;from&nbsp;China,&nbsp;Switzerland,&nbsp;Japan,&nbsp;the&nbsp;United&nbsp;Kingdom,&nbsp;France,&nbsp;Ukraine,&nbsp;Germany,&nbsp;Belgium,&nbsp;Italy,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Poland.</p><p>Expected&nbsp;this&nbsp;year&nbsp;are&nbsp;new&nbsp;publications&nbsp;by&nbsp;photographers&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;Ruth&nbsp;van&nbsp;Beek,&nbsp;Robin&nbsp;de&nbsp;Puy,&nbsp;Anton&nbsp;Corbijn,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Stephan&nbsp;Vanfleteren.&nbsp;Several&nbsp;participants&nbsp;will&nbsp;host&nbsp;signing&nbsp;sessions,&nbsp;giving&nbsp;you&nbsp;the&nbsp;chance&nbsp;to&nbsp;take&nbsp;home&nbsp;a&nbsp;truly&nbsp;special&nbsp;edition.&nbsp;More&nbsp;information&nbsp;will&nbsp;follow.&nbsp;Admission&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;Unseen&nbsp;Book&nbsp;Market&nbsp;is&nbsp;free.</p>	other	2026-03-27	2026-03-29	11:00:00	Pakhuis Santos	Rotterdam	Brede Hilledijk 95, 3072 KD	https://unseenphoto.com/bookmarket	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/scene/97144351-162a-4f5f-bd3b-5c278f77d799.webp	UdL;mexu~q%Mt7ofofRj?bayM{j[t7ofofRj	280	385	Unseen Photo Fair BV	\N	36ae98cf-e596-4157-8eb7-4391c5292b7f	\N	2026-03-11 01:40:08.868176+00	2026-03-11 02:55:26.823699+00	1	17:00:00
f45edd40-84c6-4814-bbf1-a7f924c648b5	unseen-photo-fair-20260327	Unseen Photo Fair	<p>Next&nbsp;year&nbsp;marks&nbsp;an&nbsp;exciting&nbsp;milestone&nbsp;as&nbsp;Unseen&nbsp;becomes&nbsp;fully&nbsp;integrated&nbsp;into&nbsp;Art&nbsp;Rotterdam.&nbsp;This&nbsp;collaboration&nbsp;brings&nbsp;together&nbsp;two&nbsp;passionate&nbsp;communities&nbsp;-&nbsp;Art&nbsp;Rotterdam&#39;s&nbsp;diverse&nbsp;audience&nbsp;and&nbsp;Unseen&#39;s&nbsp;photography&nbsp;enthusiasts&nbsp;-&nbsp;creating&nbsp;a&nbsp;vibrant,&nbsp;varied&nbsp;platform&nbsp;for&nbsp;both&nbsp;photography&nbsp;and&nbsp;contemporary&nbsp;art.&nbsp;</p><p>Visitors&nbsp;will&nbsp;discover&nbsp;photography&nbsp;galleries&nbsp;from&nbsp;Unseen&#39;s&nbsp;Main&nbsp;Section&nbsp;and&nbsp;Solo/Duo&nbsp;Section&nbsp;woven&nbsp;throughout&nbsp;the&nbsp;fair&nbsp;alongside&nbsp;contemporary&nbsp;art&nbsp;galleries,&nbsp;while&nbsp;our&nbsp;specially&nbsp;curated&nbsp;sections&nbsp;-&nbsp;New&nbsp;Photography,&nbsp;Encounters,&nbsp;and&nbsp;The&nbsp;Past&nbsp;Present&nbsp;-&nbsp;will&nbsp;form&nbsp;a&nbsp;dedicated&nbsp;photography&nbsp;section.</p><p>With&nbsp;approximately&nbsp;40&nbsp;exhibitors,&nbsp;visitors&nbsp;can&nbsp;expect&nbsp;to&nbsp;encounter&nbsp;both&nbsp;established&nbsp;international&nbsp;photography&nbsp;and&nbsp;contemporary&nbsp;art&nbsp;galleries&nbsp;as&nbsp;well&nbsp;as&nbsp;exciting&nbsp;emerging&nbsp;initiatives.</p><p>This&nbsp;integration&nbsp;promises&nbsp;a&nbsp;richer,&nbsp;more&nbsp;dynamic&nbsp;experience&nbsp;for&nbsp;all&nbsp;visitors,&nbsp;offering&nbsp;new&nbsp;discoveries&nbsp;at&nbsp;every&nbsp;turn.</p>	festival	2026-03-27	2026-03-29	11:00:00	Rotterdam Ahoy	Rotterdam	Ahoyweg 1, 3084 BA	https://unseenphoto.com/fair	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/scene/f45edd40-84c6-4814-bbf1-a7f924c648b5.webp	UdL;mexu~q%Mt7ofofRj?bayM{j[t7ofofRj	280	385	Unseen Photo Fair BV	€22.50	36ae98cf-e596-4157-8eb7-4391c5292b7f	\N	2026-03-11 01:45:06.540298+00	2026-0