91527546-2104-4ebf-afee-448b558d997d	haute-photographie-rotterdam-2026-20260325	Haute Photographie	<p>Located&nbsp;in&nbsp;Rotterdam&#39;s&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;M4H&nbsp;district,&nbsp;Keilepand&nbsp;will&nbsp;transform&nbsp;into&nbsp;a&nbsp;1,250&nbsp;m²&nbsp;pop-up&nbsp;museum&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;11th&nbsp;Haute&nbsp;Photographie&nbsp;Rotterdam&nbsp;fair.&nbsp;This&nbsp;boutique&nbsp;art&nbsp;fair,&nbsp;designed&nbsp;like&nbsp;a&nbsp;museum,&nbsp;is&nbsp;fully&nbsp;dedicated&nbsp;to&nbsp;fine&nbsp;art&nbsp;photography.</p><p>Breaking&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;traditional&nbsp;art&nbsp;fair&nbsp;layout,&nbsp;Haute&nbsp;Photographie&nbsp;replaces&nbsp;conventional&nbsp;booths&nbsp;with&nbsp;an&nbsp;innovative&nbsp;design&nbsp;that&nbsp;elevates&nbsp;the&nbsp;entire&nbsp;event.&nbsp;The&nbsp;fair&nbsp;will&nbsp;present&nbsp;works&nbsp;by&nbsp;50&nbsp;photographers,&nbsp;showcasing&nbsp;photography&nbsp;across&nbsp;three&nbsp;distinct&nbsp;eras:&nbsp;<em>vintage</em>&nbsp;(past),&nbsp;<em>contemporary</em>&nbsp;(present),&nbsp;and&nbsp;<em>emerging&nbsp;talent</em>&nbsp;(future).</p><p>Beyond&nbsp;the&nbsp;exhibitions,&nbsp;visitors&nbsp;can&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;a&nbsp;restaurant&nbsp;and&nbsp;explore&nbsp;a&nbsp;carefully&nbsp;curated&nbsp;photo&nbsp;book&nbsp;market.&nbsp;Haute&nbsp;Photographie&nbsp;aims&nbsp;to&nbsp;provide&nbsp;an&nbsp;immersive&nbsp;experience&nbsp;that&nbsp;appeals&nbsp;equally&nbsp;to&nbsp;seasoned&nbsp;art&nbsp;collectors&nbsp;and&nbsp;curious&nbsp;newcomers.</p><p>The&nbsp;five-day&nbsp;event&nbsp;takes&nbsp;place&nbsp;from&nbsp;March&nbsp;25&nbsp;to&nbsp;29,&nbsp;2026.&nbsp;It&nbsp;opens&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;preview&nbsp;and&nbsp;official&nbsp;launch&nbsp;on&nbsp;March&nbsp;25,&nbsp;including&nbsp;an&nbsp;exclusive&nbsp;sponsor&nbsp;evening.&nbsp;The&nbsp;program&nbsp;offers&nbsp;a&nbsp;rich&nbsp;selection&nbsp;of&nbsp;world-class&nbsp;international&nbsp;photography&nbsp;while&nbsp;highlighting&nbsp;fresh&nbsp;voices&nbsp;shaping&nbsp;the&nbsp;future&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;medium.</p><p></p><p><strong>&nbsp;OPENING&nbsp;HOURS&nbsp;ROTTERDAM&nbsp;2026</strong></p><ul><li>25-29&nbsp;March,&nbsp;2026&nbsp;during&nbsp;Rotterdam&nbsp;Art&nbsp;Week.</li><li>&nbsp;25&nbsp;March:&nbsp;14:00&nbsp;-&nbsp;18:-00&nbsp;Press&nbsp;+&nbsp;VIP&nbsp;Preview</li><li>&nbsp;25&nbsp;March:&nbsp;19:00&nbsp;-&nbsp;23:00&nbsp;Grand&nbsp;Opening&nbsp;(by&nbsp;invitation&nbsp;only)</li><li>26&nbsp;March:&nbsp;12:00&nbsp;-&nbsp;19:00&nbsp;Public&nbsp;entrance&nbsp;</li><li>27&nbsp;March:&nbsp;12:00&nbsp;-&nbsp;19:00</li><li>28&nbsp;March:&nbsp;10:00&nbsp;-&nbsp;19:00</li><li>29&nbsp;March:&nbsp;10:00&nbsp;-&nbsp;17:00</li></ul>	exhibition	2026-03-25	2026-03-29	\N	Keilepand	Rotterdam	Keilestraat 9f, 3029 BP	https://www.uitagendarotterdam.nl/agenda/haute-photographie/	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/scene/91527546-2104-4ebf-afee-448b558d997d.jpg	UNK1]^Mx00_N%Lt6M{IV%gofRPRi.8ofRjoL	1200	630	Hungry Eye Group	15	36ae98cf-e596-4157-8eb7-4391c5292b7f	\N	2026-03-10 22:05:31.09963+00	2026-03-12 12:01:45.625595+00	1	\N
4614007e-c80e-4d22-84a3-c9af07102963	iris-fotografie-20260327	Iris Fotografie	Laten we elkaar eens diep in de ogen kijken… Iris fotografie is helemaal “hot” op dit moment. Natuurlijk is het geweldig om een foto van je eigen oog aan de muur te hebben hangen, maar nog mooier is het, als je ze zelf kan maken! Van het maken van de foto’s tot het creëren van jouw eigen meesterwerk, Alco van Ingen gaat het je allemaal laten zien. Kan je dit bijvoorbeeld overal doen en waar moet je op letten? Hoe ga je om met reflecties en welke lichtbronnen werken het beste? Welke apparatuur heb je nodig en hoe krijg je het oog goed scherp? Is dit alleen in Photoshop CC te doen, of kan dit ook in Photoshop Elements? Heel veel vragen die we allemaal gaan beantwoorden. Je eigen creativiteit is de enige limiet, wij geven je graag de inspiratie!	workshop	2026-03-27	\N	14:00:00	Cameranu Antwerpen	Antwerpen	Frankrijklei 23, 2000	https://www.cameranu.nl/events/493-iris-fotografie#event-4500	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/scene/4614007e-c80e-4d22-84a3-c9af07102963.jpg	U34.MJWC00oyx]azM{js00of_NRjITjZx]bI	3300	2200	Cameranu	€89 EUR	5a11a7c5-9296-4d7d-93ed-965bd493d192	\N	2026-03-12 06:27:31.53092+00	2026-03-12 13:57:40.950155+00	0	17:00:00
