d4b65044-26e0-4049-9abb-c5aeee4812b5	rotterdam-photo-20260325	Rotterdam Photo 2026	<p>Rotterdam&nbsp;Photo&nbsp;is&nbsp;an&nbsp;annual&nbsp;photography&nbsp;fair&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;festival&nbsp;flair,&nbsp;celebrating&nbsp;the&nbsp;full&nbsp;spectrum&nbsp;of&nbsp;contemporary&nbsp;photography&nbsp;in&nbsp;all&nbsp;its&nbsp;diversity.</p><p>Founded&nbsp;in&nbsp;2016,&nbsp;Rotterdam&nbsp;Photo&nbsp;is&nbsp;an&nbsp;accessible&nbsp;and&nbsp;innovative&nbsp;photography&nbsp;festival.&nbsp;Featuring&nbsp;adistinctive&nbsp;container&nbsp;village,&nbsp;Rotterdam&nbsp;Photo&nbsp;creates&nbsp;a&nbsp;visually&nbsp;striking&nbsp;and&nbsp;accessible&nbsp;event&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;city’s&nbsp;Art&nbsp;Axis.</p><p>Inspired&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;history&nbsp;of&nbsp;Rotterdam&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;port&nbsp;city,&nbsp;the&nbsp;festival&nbsp;provides&nbsp;the&nbsp;selected&nbsp;photographers&nbsp;with&nbsp;exhibition&nbsp;space&nbsp;in&nbsp;repurposed&nbsp;shipping&nbsp;containers,&nbsp;as&nbsp;well&nbsp;as&nbsp;the&nbsp;public&nbsp;space&nbsp;of&nbsp;Rotterdam&nbsp;city&nbsp;to&nbsp;bring&nbsp;photography&nbsp;outside&nbsp;the&nbsp;‘white&nbsp;cube’&nbsp;tradition.</p><p>In&nbsp;addition&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;exhibitions,&nbsp;Rotterdam&nbsp;Photo&nbsp;organizes&nbsp;talks,&nbsp;workshops,&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;fringe&nbsp;program&nbsp;with&nbsp;music&nbsp;and&nbsp;digital&nbsp;installations&nbsp;throughout&nbsp;the&nbsp;city.&nbsp;The&nbsp;festival&nbsp;feeling&nbsp;is&nbsp;created&nbsp;thanks&nbsp;to&nbsp;various&nbsp;exhibitions&nbsp;and&nbsp;leisure&nbsp;activities.&nbsp;Street&nbsp;vendors,&nbsp;cafes,&nbsp;and&nbsp;restaurants&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;festival’s&nbsp;location&nbsp;offer&nbsp;great&nbsp;food&nbsp;and&nbsp;delicious&nbsp;drinks&nbsp;–&nbsp;the&nbsp;public&nbsp;and&nbsp;participants&nbsp;can&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;the&nbsp;events’&nbsp;atmosphere,&nbsp;celebrating&nbsp;photography&nbsp;together&nbsp;with&nbsp;us.</p><p></p><p><strong>Rotterdam&nbsp;Photo&nbsp;&nbsp;2026&nbsp;–&nbsp;Entry&nbsp;fee</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Early&nbsp;bird&nbsp;tickets&nbsp;(available&nbsp;until&nbsp;March&nbsp;1):</strong>&nbsp;€4.50&nbsp;+&nbsp;€1.00&nbsp;service&nbsp;fee&nbsp;(20%&nbsp;discount)</li><li><strong>Regular&nbsp;tickets:</strong>&nbsp;€5.50&nbsp;+&nbsp;€1.00&nbsp;service&nbsp;fee</li><li><strong>Group&nbsp;tickets:</strong>&nbsp;€5.00&nbsp;+&nbsp;€1.00&nbsp;service&nbsp;fee&nbsp;(10%&nbsp;discount&nbsp;for&nbsp;photo&nbsp;clubs&nbsp;and&nbsp;groups&nbsp;of&nbsp;5+)</li><li><strong>Rotterdampas&nbsp;holders</strong>:&nbsp;25%&nbsp;discount,&nbsp;available&nbsp;only&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;festival&nbsp;cash&nbsp;desk</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Opening&nbsp;hours:</strong></p><ul><li>Wednesday,&nbsp;March&nbsp;25&nbsp;–&nbsp;from&nbsp;18.00&nbsp;till&nbsp;22.00</li><li>Thursday,&nbsp;March&nbsp;26&nbsp;–&nbsp;&nbsp;from&nbsp;11.00&nbsp;till&nbsp;18.00</li><li>Friday,&nbsp;March&nbsp;27&nbsp;–&nbsp;from&nbsp;11.00&nbsp;till&nbsp;18.00</li><li>Saturday,&nbsp;March&nbsp;28&nbsp;–&nbsp;from&nbsp;11.00&nbsp;till&nbsp;20.00</li><li>Sunday,&nbsp;March&nbsp;29&nbsp;–&nbsp;&nbsp;from&nbsp;11.00&nbsp;till&nbsp;18.00</li></ul>	festival	2026-03-25	2026-03-29	\N	Deliplein	Rotterdam	Deliplein, 3072 ZL	https://www.rotterdamphoto.eu/	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/scene/d4b65044-26e0-4049-9abb-c5aeee4812b5.png	U01yLNoe9Fj[ofj[WBay4oay%LayayfQj@j[	400	400	Rotterdam Photo	6.50	36ae98cf-e596-4157-8eb7-4391c5292b7f	\N	2026-03-11 17:34:35.226639+00	2026-03-12 12:07:55.976269+00	1	\N
e3789e09-a167-4b2b-bc02-435d2ec94f38	iris-fotografie-20260627	Iris Fotografie	Laten we elkaar eens diep in de ogen kijken… Iris fotografie is helemaal “hot” op dit moment. Natuurlijk is het geweldig om een foto van je eigen oog aan de muur te hebben hangen, maar nog mooier is het, als je ze zelf kan maken! Van het maken van de foto’s tot het creëren van jouw eigen meesterwerk, Alco van Ingen gaat het je allemaal laten zien. Kan je dit bijvoorbeeld overal doen en waar moet je op letten? Hoe ga je om met reflecties en welke lichtbronnen werken het beste? Welke apparatuur heb je nodig en hoe krijg je het oog goed scherp? Is dit alleen in Photoshop CC te doen, of kan dit ook in Photoshop Elements? Heel veel vragen die we allemaal gaan beantwoorden. Je eigen creativiteit is de enige limiet, wij geven je graag de inspiratie!	workshop	2026-06-27	\N	13:30:00	Cameranu Antwerpen	Antwerpen	Frankrijklei 23, 2000	https://www.cameranu.nl/events/493-iris-fotografie#event-5151	https://db.creativephotography.group/storage/v1/object/public/event-covers/scene/e3789e09-a167-4b2b-bc02-435d2ec94f38.jpg	U34.MJWC00oyx]azM{js00of_NRjITjZx]bI	3300	2200	Cameranu	€89 EUR	5a11a7c5-9296-4d7d-93ed-965bd493d192	\N	2026-03-24 00:03:56.818364+00	2026-03-24 00:03:57.039486+00	0	16:30:00
